[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/the-taking-dark.png" id="3_icon"]

; The dark wizard's own spell (.ai/dark-wizard-playable.md), and a CONJUNCTION (ComboCatalog): Hollow Star's
; Black Sun and Kindled Ward's Pyre, his darkness and the light he took. A hand of his dark light seizes the
; strongest in reach and the tear collapses on what stands round it; the light drifts home searing what it
; passes; caught, two lanes of his light cross the field. Darkness and Light, its parents' base tags summed.
;
; The one Conjunction with levels (ComboDefinition.StartsFusedFor): the dark wizard opens on it made, at level
; 1, and every card levels it to 8 off the table below; anyone else who fuses it gets it whole, at 8, with
; nothing left to take (Player.TryFuse). No milestone of its own: from level 4 a caught light throws a star of
; four lanes, and at 8 the hand closes on the strongest and the three nearest it (TheTaking).
;
; BaseProjectileCount is hands a cast, each at its own quarry. BaseRange is the reach a quarry is found in
; (Player.FireTheTaking); the lanes and the burn are Area's (Player.TakingLaneLength, Width, BurnRadius),
; grown by the AreaSize lines below, read as 1 + their sum.
